## PageIndex

PDFIndex is inspired by the vectorless, tree-structured document indexing
approach pioneered by [PageIndex](https://github.com/VectifyAI/PageIndex)
(Vectify AI). The technique (structure-as-index, agent reasoning over section
trees, retrieval-as-tools) informed this project's design.

This project is a **deliberately reduced reimplementation**, not a fork or
redistribution of the PageIndex codebase. It is **not affiliated with, endorsed
by, or sponsored by Vectify AI**.

